{"luma|Bye for now!":["d6709efcb9f0.mp3",1200],"luma|I’m reading about the moon. It has no lanterns at all!":["1b6bfb139ff0.mp3",3216],"luma|Stay as long as you like. Tap when you want to get up.":["801e0647f415.mp3",3120],"luma|This is my quiet corner. You can sit here too, if you like.":["daad4b64320a.mp3",3720],"moss|Hmm. One note was wobbly. I’ll keep tinkering.":["f6bd31cd97b9.mp3",3312],"moss|I’m fixing a music box. Listen!":["232ea83e8275.mp3",2616],"narrator|A lantern from the launch night. Every job helped.":["5ca07339cdfb.mp3",3216],"narrator|A little paddle wheel from the mill. Splish, clunk!":["88ea87a89485.mp3",3120],"narrator|A souvenir from Windmill Hill will hang here.":["3fc8ee8f9c75.mp3",2520],"narrator|Something you make will go here.":["be24ea6c71b6.mp3",1752],"narrator|Tap anywhere to walk. Tap things to try them.":["f0a36eb2bc43.mp3",2880],"narrator|Tap high or low to steer through the seed rings.":["6491ba5a54fc.mp3",2808],"narrator|Tap the paper glider!":["32a191a0d345.mp3",1464],"narrator|The dress-up chest! Everyone can wear anything.":["9ec563a0574b.mp3",2880],"narrator|The flag from the Picnic Bridge. Everyone made it across!":["c7dd9ec5a878.mp3",3504],"narrator|The pinwheel from the snail on the windmill.":["036f58fb1558.mp3",2328],"narrator|The snacks from your picnic! Crunch, squish, slurp.":["dfe7f23f3a24.mp3",3048],"narrator|This frame is waiting for a place Rowan is still building.":["0161c438c5a7.mp3",3384],"narrator|Welcome to the clubhouse! Everything you make can live here.":["a2445b7e75bc.mp3",3360],"narrator|Your kite tail from Windmill Hill!":["433d944975a2.mp3",1872],"narrator|Your puppet show! Watch the first scene.":["513d67a28f15.mp3",2328],"pip|A kite rescuer! My kite’s stuck up there. Want to help?":["9f3e11d7da3c.mp3",3240],"pip|Bonk! That one hit the windmill.":["6e62000dc01e.mp3",0],"pip|Bonk! Too low that time.":["7f1dc4e9988f.mp3",1752],"pip|Hey! Want a turn with my launcher?":["d53e163ec523.mp3",2040],"pip|If it lands in the soft nest, it won’t get squished.":["1302523a6f4e.mp3",0],"pip|It landed there… whoosh! The windmill breeze blew it back up!":["d1911bdf5f4a.mp3",0],"pip|My kite! The wind snapped the string!":["3016b4a55681.mp3",2328],"pip|Not yet — I’m in the middle of one! After this?":["25a1e8d92248.mp3",2736],"pip|Oh no… it’s stuck on the windmill.":["babedc802632.mp3",2088],"pip|Okay! I’ll be right here if you change your mind.":["197b056c7e9e.mp3",2736],"pip|Okay! Your turn will be here when you’re back.":["b566bcc0826c.mp3",2376],"pip|One more go, then it’s your turn!":["37970e905a8f.mp3",2040],"pip|Pick an arrow, then pump!":["2a8e586d47de.mp3",1368],"pip|Right into the nest! Perfect landing!":["c6b53f844ef7.mp3",0],"pip|Still missing! Want to try now? It’s fine if not.":["e265556c1fff.mp3",2952],"pip|Sure! Pick an arrow, then pump the bellows.":["f31f14ec50f7.mp3",2448],"pip|Tap the arrow you think, and I’ll point it. Then you pump!":["9a4e95db223f.mp3",3072],"pip|Thanks for waiting. Your turn!":["5a9307b0a952.mp3",1896],"pip|The wind blew it back! Maybe a different arrow?":["8dab56fcaefe.mp3",0],"pip|There you are! I saved your turn.":["30a6ddf3eb1d.mp3",2040],"pip|Way up high! The wind sent it back.":["e9920f1f5ff4.mp3",0],"pip|Whoa! The wind pushed it back!":["99126da72cfa.mp3",1776],"pip|Yes! Do you want to aim, or pump?":["56df4a016c70.mp3",1992],"pip|You got it! Look — it’s floating down!":["af8538af5685.mp3",2160],"pip|You pick the arrow. I’ll pump when you say go!":["b5e295b3fca1.mp3",2592]}
